# Seed → home Recently added

When adding any **new** event seed id (`fallback.*.json` or `recurring.*.json`):

1. Add the same `id` to `SEED_CREATED_AT` in `src/lib/seed-created-at.ts`
2. Use commit-day noon UTC, e.g. `"2026-09-09T12:00:00.000Z"`
3. Without this, the event page can work while home **Recently added** omits it (`getNewHighlightEvents` requires `createdAt` within 14 days)

Also wire images, attributions, and curated `isFree`/tickets as usual.
